<!--
    The themed-icon layer for Android 13 and up. The system draws it as a flat
    silhouette in the user's palette, so it is the coin reduced to its outline
    and the pulse across it — the painting itself has nothing that survives
    being flattened to one colour.

    The group scales the mark down to the 66dp the mask is guaranteed to show:
    the drawing is authored in a 24-unit square that stands for the full 108dp
    layer, and 0.7 of that lands inside the safe circle with room to spare.
-->
